@startuml
title MiniRhoFor Language Spec to Runtime Backend Handoff

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4
skinparam defaultFontColor #111827
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

rectangle "Static Language Path" as StaticPath #DBEAFE {
  rectangle "language! specification\ncategories, syntax, rewrites" as Spec #BFDBFE
  rectangle "LanguageDef\nmacro-time model" as LangDef #BFDBFE
  rectangle "LanguageMetadata\ngenerated inventory" as Metadata #BFDBFE
  rectangle "Dovetail rules\nexact rewrite requirements" as Rules #BFDBFE
}

rectangle "Runtime Snippet Path" as RuntimePath #DCFCE7 {
  rectangle "source snippet\n{ for (x <- a) { x!(z) } | a!(b) }" as Source #BBF7D0
  rectangle "retained MeTTaIL parser\nWPDA typed frontend" as Parser #BBF7D0
  rectangle "typed AST\nProc::PPar(...)" as TypedAst #BBF7D0
  rectangle "Dovetail saturation\nand checked extraction" as Dovetail #BBF7D0
  rectangle "DovetailRunReport\nexact keys, edges, completeness" as Report #FEF3C7
}

rectangle "Direct Dovetail Runtime Path" as DirectPath #E0F2FE {
  rectangle "Dovetail runtime adapter\nreport projection" as DirectAdapter #BAE6FD
  rectangle "RuntimeBackendOutput::Dovetail\nreport-shaped result" as DirectOutput #CFFAFE
}

rectangle "Rho Runtime Path" as RhoPath #FCE7F3 {
  rectangle "Rho backend lowerer\ncomplete reports only" as Lowerer #FBCFE8
  rectangle "rhoapi::Par\nnormalized AST artifact" as Par #FDE68A
  rectangle "F1r3node RhoRuntime\nRSpace COMM scheduling" as Runtime #FBCFE8
  rectangle "RuntimeBackendReport\nobserved values and evidence" as RuntimeReport #EDE9FE
}

Spec --> LangDef : parse macro input
LangDef --> Metadata : generate typed inventory
Metadata --> Rules : derive rule table
Rules --> Dovetail : semantic requirements

Source --> Parser : parse source text
Parser --> TypedAst : emit typed term
TypedAst --> Dovetail : seed exact root
Dovetail --> Report : freeze checked derivation forest

Report --> DirectAdapter : RuntimeBackend::Dovetail
DirectAdapter --> DirectOutput : preserve report shape

Report --> Lowerer : RuntimeBackend::RhoMachine\nrequire Complete
Lowerer --> Par : emit AST, not text
Par --> Runtime : inject executable artifact
Runtime --> RuntimeReport : observations plus evidence refs

Metadata ..> Parser : category and constructor authority
Metadata ..> Lowerer : inventory-derived channels and tags

note bottom of Report #FFFBEB
  The report is a typed handoff artifact:
  it is not a prose log, not Rholang text,
  and not proof that the runtime already executed.
end note

note bottom of DirectOutput #EFF6FF
  Direct Dovetail execution stops here.
  The caller receives checked rewrite evidence,
  not post-Rho runtime observations.
end note

note right of Par #FFFBEB
  Rholang text in docs is reader annotation.
  The generated value is AST so the same boundary
  can feed an interpreter or bytecode emitter.
end note
@enduml
